    <item>
      <title>Power-sensitive partnerships for just nature-based solutions in urban informal settlements</title>
      <link>https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-79301-2</link>
      <content:encoded>
                &lt;p&gt;Nature Communications, Published online: 13 November 2026; &lt;a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-79301-2"&gt;doi:10.1038/s41467-026-79301-2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Nature-based solutions should better redistribute benefits and reduce climate risks for vulnerable groups in urban informal settlements. To enable this, we argue for power-sensitive partnerships and a deep commitment to pluralism in values, ways of knowing, and understandings of nature.</content:encoded>
