      <title>Selective aromatization of polyolefins by temporal decoupling from cracking</title>
      <link>https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-79441-5</link>
      <content:encoded>
                &lt;p&gt;Nature Communications, Published online: 13 November 2026; &lt;a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-79441-5"&gt;doi:10.1038/s41467-026-79441-5&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Turning plastic waste into useful chemicals is limited because breaking polymer chains and controlling products need conflicting conditions. This study separates these steps in time, enabling fast, durable aromatic production with lower emissions.</content:encoded>
